sequenceDiagram
    participant App as BLECentralManager
    participant CM as CBCentralManager
    participant Peer as CBPeripheral

    App->>CM: init(delegate: self, queue: BLEActor.queue)
    CM-->>App: centralManagerDidUpdateState(.poweredOn)
    App->>CM: scanForPeripherals([serviceUUID], allowDuplicates)
    CM-->>App: didDiscover(peripheral, advertisementData, RSSI)

    App->>CM: connect(peripheral)
    CM-->>App: didConnect(peripheral)
    App->>Peer: discoverServices([serviceUUID])
    Peer-->>App: didDiscoverServices
    App->>Peer: discoverCharacteristics([handshake, payload, control])
    Peer-->>App: didDiscoverCharacteristicsFor(service)
    App->>Peer: setNotifyValue(true) on payload + control
    Peer-->>App: didUpdateNotificationStateFor(characteristic)
    Note over App,Peer: link ready for handshake
